+# `build_reminder` Callable Contract
+
+## Signature
+
+```python
+build_reminder(action, now) -> dict | None
+```
+
+`action` is a mapping. The function returns `None` for any action whose `confirmed` value is not the literal `True`.
+
+For a confirmed action, `id` and `owner` must be non-empty strings and `due_at` must be an ISO-8601 UTC string; malformed values raise `ValueError`. `now` accepts an aware UTC `datetime` or UTC ISO-8601 string.
+
+The returned mapping has exactly `id`, `action_id`, `owner`, `due_at`, and `remind_at`. Both timestamps use a `Z` suffix. It has no side effects and does not mutate `action`.
