+# S006 Data Model
+
+## Action input mapping
+
+| Field | Type | Rule |
+|-------|------|------|
+| `confirmed` | boolean-like | Only the literal value `True` enables validation and scheduling. |
+| `id` | string | Required and non-empty when confirmed. |
+| `owner` | string | Required and non-empty when confirmed. |
+| `due_at` | string | Required ISO-8601 UTC timestamp when confirmed. |
+
+## Reminder output mapping
+
+| Field | Source | Rule |
+|-------|--------|------|
+| `id` | action `id` and emitted `due_at` | `reminder:{action_id}:{due_at}` |
+| `action_id` | action `id` | unchanged string |
+| `owner` | action `owner` | unchanged string |
+| `due_at` | action `due_at` | normalized UTC ISO-8601 with `Z` |
+| `remind_at` | derived | normalized UTC ISO-8601 with `Z` |
+
